## Breaking Changes

There are no breaking changes in AG Grid version {% migrationVersion() %}.

## Behaviour Changes

There are no behaviour changes in AG Grid version {% migrationVersion() %}.

## Removal of Deprecated APIs

There are no deprecated API removals in AG Grid version {% migrationVersion() %}.

## Deprecations

The following grid option (`GridOptions`) remains supported, but the replacement below is recommended:

| Deprecated | Replacement                             |
| ---------- | --------------------------------------- |
| `debug`    | `enableDevValidations({ debug: true })` |

The replacement applies to all grids on the page rather than a single grid. See [Debug Logging](./dev-validation/#debug-logging).

The following event remains supported and continues to fire, but the replacement below is recommended:

| Deprecated                          | Replacement                                                              |
| ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| `calculatedColumnExpressionChanged` | `calculatedColumnChanged`, checking `event.changes.calculatedExpression` |

Each locale in `@ag-grid-community/locale` is now exported under its full BCP47 tag, for example `AG_GRID_LOCALE_DA_DK` for `da-DK`. The following region-only exports remain supported, but the replacements below are recommended. See [Provided Locales](./localisation/#provided-locales).

| Deprecated          | Replacement            |
| ------------------- | ---------------------- |
| `AG_GRID_LOCALE_BG` | `AG_GRID_LOCALE_BG_BG` |
| `AG_GRID_LOCALE_BR` | `AG_GRID_LOCALE_PT_BR` |
| `AG_GRID_LOCALE_CN` | `AG_GRID_LOCALE_ZH_CN` |
